    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be6924e3690dfa24",
      "translationZh": "令人惊叹的 Qwen3.8 27B 的 Swift 微调版本在基准性能几乎相当的情况下生成的 token 要少得多，而像 HyperQwen（以前的 syv-ai/qwen38-27b-rtx3090）这样的仓库在 RTX 3090 上能够提供极高的 TPS。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1750fd31ef58f5bc",
      "translationZh": "为了兼顾两方面的优势，我将 Swift 1 和 Swift 1.5 移植到 HyperQwen，并将其与 HyperQwen 专用的 W4A16 AutoRound 快速量化在速度和质量方面进行了基准测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ace958f44662537f",
      "translationZh": "模型 平均时间/任务 ↓ 平均输出 token/任务 ↓ 解码 token/s ↑",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47ff6e552f544c26",
      "translationZh": "Qwen - HyperQwen 快速量化",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "142f794e22838317",
      "translationZh": "Swift 1.5 + HyperQwen，INT8 头",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36aad429da4322a2",
      "translationZh": "Swift 1.5 + HyperQwen INT4 头",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d6256fde5797633",
      "translationZh": "所有模型在一块 RTX 3090 24GB 上运行，使用 FP8 KV 缓存和配置的 150k 上下文。平均任务时间涵盖下面列出的不同基准测试中的约 630 个任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8704b30a580a8604",
      "translationZh": "Swift-1 似乎使用的 token 最少，任务完成时间最快。Swift-1.5-INT4 相比 HyperQwen Qwen 快速模型的平均每任务时间降低了约 37%。尽管由于草稿接受率较低导致 TPS 略有下降，但由于它生成的 token 更少，因此完成得更快。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "102b366759edb519",
      "translationZh": "模型之间存在一些轻微的质量和性能权衡：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
